<title>JAPAN: TENNIS-PAN PACIFIC OPEN SEMI-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-PAN PACIFIC OPEN SEMI-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semi-final results in the Pan Pacific Open women's tennis tournament on Saturday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>2-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat Anke Huber (Germany) 6-1 5-7 6-2.</p>
<p>1-Steffi Graf (Germany) beat 8-Brenda Schultz-McCarthy (Netherlands) 6-1 7-5.</p>
</text>
